  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank three grass Gu shaped like a red lantern, with round green leaves. The leaves are thick and fat, three in all, pointing in three directions in symmetry.",
        "chapters": [
          160
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After refinement it resides on Fang Yuan’s tongue as a tattoo. When he injects primeval essence, the tattoo comes alive; he spits it out and it rotates like a lantern in mid-air, floating in front of him. After it finishes storing, it returns to his mouth and becomes a red flower lantern tattoo on the tongue again.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It stores food, and it also stores primeval stones. Fang Yuan rates that combination as one of the most ideal storage Gu he can hold at that time.",
        "chapters": [
          160
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_storage_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among rank three storage Gu he ranks it as one of the better ones. It can store a maximum of thirty thousand primeval stones. If he also stores other goods, he estimates about fifteen thousand primeval stones as a practical ceiling.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He pours primeval essence into it to take items out. Red light flashes, lights the area, and a formless attraction pulls primeval stones from their bags into the flower. Later he uses the same method to take out a primeval stone, and he plans to keep the flower for miscellaneous goods once a treasure lotus covers his stone income.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
